work/run.log:1841:{"problem_category":"Create new RTL from spec","learning":"For empty staged RTL on spec-driven harnesses, implement the exact top-level module and cocotb-visible ports first, then match the stated parameterization before refining datapath behavior.\nFor CIC decimators, compute the decimation decision from the accepted input handshake, update integrators on every accepted sample, and advance the comb section only on decimated output events.\nClamp runtime rate control into the supported `[1, RMAX]` range so zero or oversized values do not break the cycle counter or handshake behavior."}
